WEBVTT

00:19:59.554 --> 00:20:00.752
is they cut the ends off.

00:20:00.776 --> 00:20:03.254
And the child says, "Why do you do that?"

00:20:03.278 --> 00:20:05.006
They say, "Well it's in the recipe.

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:07.445
So let's call a grandparent and see."

00:20:07.469 --> 00:20:09.371
They call the grandparent and they say,

00:20:09.395 --> 00:20:12.034
"I've just always done it,
that's what's in the recipe."

00:20:12.058 --> 00:20:13.503
And the family was very lucky

00:20:13.527 --> 00:20:15.597
that the great grandparent
was still around,

00:20:15.621 --> 00:20:18.428
so they called the great grandparent
that wrote the recipe.

00:20:18.452 --> 00:20:19.615
And they say,

00:20:19.639 --> 00:20:22.726
"Oh well my pan was just too small
so I always cut the ends off."

00:20:22.750 --> 00:20:24.295
(Laughter)

00:20:24.319 --> 00:20:26.792
So the idea being that we just do things

00:20:26.816 --> 00:20:28.795
because we thought that's what was right.

00:20:28.819 --> 00:20:31.957
And when you have these strong cultures